window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'd led a selfish existence. </p> <p>I liked who I was. Hell, I loved myself. </p> <p>Women threw themselves at me, and I took what they offered without remorse. I promised them nothing. I sank my teeth into life, holding on to it like my very existence depended on it. </p> <p>Time passed. </p> <p>Women came and went. </p> <p>The second I let my guard down and released the hold I had on life, what was my award for such carelessness? </p> <p>A love so spectacular and heart-wrenching that it threw me for a loop. When I was in too deep to escape, my greatest fears became reality. </p> <p>This is my story. </p> <p>My downfall. </p> <p>My salvation. </p>"; 
